Q6. Insert all rows with the designation 'trainee' from the EMP1 table to EMP_trainee table.

Answer:

INSERT INTO EMP_trainee
SELECT ID, Name, Basic, Designation, Age
FROM EMP1
WHERE Designation = 'Trainee';

COMMIT;

